<hgroup><h1>Real-time quality control in optoacoustic mesoscopy for enhancing data quality and standardization in clinical studies</h1></hgroup><div class="cg p">
<a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Rojas%20L%C3%B3pez%20MB"[Author]' class="usa-link" aria-describedby="id1"><span class="name western">María Begoña Rojas López</span></a><div hidden="hidden" id="id1">
