<div id="anp_a" class="d-panel p" style="display: none"><div class="notes p"><section id="historyarticle-meta1" class="history"><p>Received 2026 May 28; Revised 2026 Aug 19; Accepted 2026 Aug 25; Collection date 2026 Oct.</p></section></div></div>
