</div></div></section></section><section id="da0005"><h2 class="pmc_sec_title">Data availability</h2>
<p id="p0005">Data will be made available on request.</p></section><section id="bibliog0005" class="ref-list"><h2 class="pmc_sec_title">References</h2>
<section id="bibliog0005_sec2"><ul class="ref-list font-sm" style="list-style-type:none">
<li id="bib1">
<span class="label">1.</span><cite>Omar M., Aguirre J., Ntziachristos V. Optoacoustic mesoscopy for biomedicine. Nat. Biomed. Eng. 2019 doi: 10.1038/s41551-019-0377-4.</cite> [<a href="https://doi.org/10.1038/s41551-019-0377-4" class="usa-link usa-link--external" data-ga-action="click_feat_suppl" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">DOI</a>] [<a href="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/30988470/" class="usa-link">PubMed</a>] [<a href="https://scholar.google.com/scholar_lookup?journal=Nat.%20Biomed.%20Eng.&amp;title=Optoacoustic%20mesoscopy%20for%20biomedicine&amp;author=M.%20Omar&amp;author=J.%20Aguirre&amp;author=V.%20Ntziachristos&amp;publication_year=2019&amp;pmid=30988470&amp;doi=10.1038/s41551-019-0377-4&amp;" class="usa-link usa-link--external" data-ga-action="click_feat_suppl" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Scholar</a>]</li>
<li id="bib2">
